Linux Interview Questions (DevOps – AWS)

1. 🔗 Soft Link vs Hard Link Confusion
Question:- You created a soft link (symbolic link) to /etc/app/config.yaml. After deployment, the link is broken, but the original file is still there. Why did it break? If it were a hard link, would it break?
Simple Explanation:-
▪  A soft link is like a shortcut — if the original file moves or is deleted, the link breaks.
▪  A hard link is like a clone — it still works because it points to the same data on disk (same inode).
▪  Use hard links when you want the file to work even if renamed or moved within the same partition.

2. 🚫 Script Permission Denied
Question:- You copied a script and tried running it with ./deploy.sh, but it says “Permission denied.” Even after chmod 777, it still doesn’t work. Why?
Simple Explanation:-
▪  It's not always about permissions.
▪  Wrong line endings (from Windows): use dos2unix deploy.sh.
